\pard\plain \sl288\slmult1\ltrch\loch \f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 was wrapped in a black shawl like a mourner. Her double-winged chair loomed over her, and the look she gave him, with her filmy eyes, if he were to paint it, he\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92d paint it saying, \u8220\'93I\u8217\'92m sorry you have to see me like this.\u8221\'94 And then that smirk said something like, \u8220\'93If you\u8217\'92d known me when I was younger, when I was prettier and vibrant, then we would might have been friends, maybe more, but I understand that you want nothing to do with me, and honestly, I don\u8217\'92t want anything to do with you because life hasn\u8217\'92t stabbed you in the gut and so you don\u8217\'92t really know who you are yet.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 She might not have been thinking that. She probably wasn\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92t. An old woman had told him that once, and so he assumed that every old woman with a natural lightness was thinking that. But then her mood shifted, and her smirk alighted, a sudden smile, as though suddenly remembering her manners.}
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8220\'93You must be the painter,\u8221\'94 she said, voice clearer than expected. \u8220\'93Your name?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8220\'93Mandri,\u8221\'94 he replied.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8220\'93Mandriiii,\u8221\'94 she said with a grandmothering lilt. \u8220\'93Yes. Come in, come in, come in. The young Vigram craves your indulgence in the dining room.\u8221\'94  She pushed herself up and out of her chair, straining with the effort, making him feel awkward for not offering to help. Once standing, she was firm on her feet.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8220\'93I am Pel,\u8221\'94 she said.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8220\'93Are you Vigram\u8217\'92s mother?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 She shook her head. \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8220\'93I am not certain of our relation.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1}